    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortune is an ordinary small town shrouded by\u00a0giant trees\u00a0that blanket the entire planet. A murder case has disrupted the peace.\u00a0You will play the role of a senior detective, collecting evidence along the way to revealing the truth. How the case will develop and end depends on your different choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the investigation progresses, you will discover that the underlying causes behind the case are far from simple. The collusion between commercial companies and politicians continues to create more &quot;accidents&quot; for ordinary people, in order to conceal their pursuit of power and desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, you may wonder why the planet where Fortune Town is shrouded in countless\u00a0giant trees, Why do residents resemble humans in appearance but have developed two completely different cultures and technologies in the upper\u00a0World and under\u00a0World. These mysteries can also be pieced together into a complete answer through the information you inadvertently collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an RPG\u00a0detective narrative game. In the game, you can discover and collect props, clues, and other items in levels, seek out key characters, or explore this novel small town. Every step you take allows you to choose different story paths, which will guide the case investigation toward independent plotlines and  influence the ending. We have prepared multiple endings, and any main character you encounter in the game may become a key figure affecting the case.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortune is an ordinary small town shrouded by\u00a0giant trees\u00a0that blanket the entire planet. A murder case has disrupted the peace.\u00a0You will play the role of a senior detective, collecting evidence along the way to revealing the truth. How the case will develop and end depends on your different choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the investigation progresses, you will discover that the underlying causes behind the case are far from simple. The collusion between commercial companies and politicians continues to create more &quot;accidents&quot; for ordinary people, in order to conceal their pursuit of power and desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, you may wonder why the planet where Fortune Town is shrouded in countless\u00a0giant trees, Why do residents resemble humans in appearance but have developed two completely different cultures and technologies in the upper\u00a0World and under\u00a0World. These mysteries can also be pieced together into a complete answer through the information you inadvertently collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an RPG\u00a0detective narrative game. In the game, you can discover and collect props, clues, and other items in levels, seek out key characters, or explore this novel small town. Every step you take allows you to choose different story paths, which will guide the case investigation toward independent plotlines and  influence the ending. We have prepared multiple endings, and any main character you encounter in the game may become a key figure affecting the case.</p>",
